# One canonical host: https://btservant.ai (the `site` in astro.config.mjs and
# every canonical, sitemap and JSON-LD URL).
#
# Host-level redirects are NOT done here: Cloudflare Pages ignores
# domain-level rules in this file. www.btservant.ai → btservant.ai and
# btservant.com / www.btservant.com → btservant.ai are zone Redirect Rules
# (see docs/deployment.md).

# The static site used .html file names; send them straight to the canonical
# trailing-slash URL in one hop.
/index.html           /                301
/organizations.html   /organizations/  301
